{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06L9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$A$", "MATH_0002": "$k$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Spec(A) \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Spec(k) \\to S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-Artinian-affine}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-artinian-finite-type}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3de1d29a0d87b724cfa4de36f4715fbd556d8900b4324fa61a483add5eebbc0a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8698b4fea46d8799e8da28648b722613d6aa15dfa32f0197ca4255df73155e03", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf <MATH_0001> is an Artinian local ring with residue field <MATH_0002>, then\nany morphism <MATH_0003> is affine and of finite type if and\nonly if the induced morphism <MATH_0004> is of finite type, see\nMorphisms, Lemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:75257dfe45c7cc5c8cde01968843c306b39457f87107f83dd02d5ca41d461283", "unit_id": "tag:06L9:prose-0002"}
